    {
      "id": "Route228_Text_SovereignShadeIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "...Greetings.\r",
        "Me? I’m Shade.\n",
        "A leader in the Battle Zone.\r",
        "The darkness... It’s compelling.\n",
        "It shields against the harsh light...\r",
        "Do you want to test your light\n",
        "against me for a {COLOR 1}Shadow Badge{COLOR 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route228_Text_SovereignShadeBattle",
      "en_US": "Show me what light means...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route228_Text_SovereignShadeReward",
      "en_US": "...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route228_Text_SovereignShadeReceived",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Shadow Badge from Shade!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route228_Text_SovereignShadeExplain",
      "en_US": [
        "The Shadow Badge.\n",
        "It’s a reminder of impending darkness.\r",
        "Functionally speaking?\n",
        "It’ll do nothing for you.\r",
        "But it’s nothing personal, kid."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route228_Text_SovereignShadeThanks",
      "en_US": [
        "Shade: Dark-type Pokémon...\n",
        "They can be vicious and difficult.\r",
        "But they can understand you in a\n",
        "way other Pokémon are incapable of."
      ]
    }
  ]
